supabase/.temp/

# Temp files and models
#
# WARNING: the driving simulator loads a .glb at runtime, so this rule excludes
# a RUNTIME DEPENDENCY from the repository — a fresh clone or a Vercel build
# has no car model and the simulator 404s. See docs/3D_ASSETS.md before
# changing how the model is shipped; once compressed, un-ignore it with a
# negation such as `!public/car.glb`.
*.glb
mmm.md
error_log.txt
temp_interior.gltf
.screenshots/


